-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2611","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2611-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["电学","光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"49dc01b07924850d419540ff17330558544d94c01cdabb2fcedb048813abe221","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 弗兰克-赫兹实验原理如图甲所示，把汞放入抽成真空的玻璃容器，容器中就充满了汞蒸气。阴极灯丝 K 通电加热后发射电子(忽略电子的初速度)，电子通过 K-G 空间加速后进入 G-A 空间，如果能量较大就可以克服 G-A 间的反向电场到达接收电极 A，形成电流通过电流表。已知汞原子能级图如图乙所示，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/40b6f99b1c9ea023ea51eb2f98befff89f83af8c0f07609af8a5bccc4607b718.png","width":390,"height":266,"width_mm":45.78,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2611-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/83b9eb0840cbdf173f43db32af9ba7ee8c60c779d09c175ace3cb8257a010d5f.png","width":393,"height":238,"width_mm":46.2,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2611-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 若 G-K 间加 4.9V 电压, 所有电子与汞原子碰撞后都无法到达 A 极"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. G-K 间电压从 4.9V 缓慢增大到 9.8V 的过程中, 电流表的示数会先减小后增大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 大量汞原子从 n=4 能级向低能级跃迁, 能使逸出功为 3.0 eV 的金属发生光电效应的光子共 4 种"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 电子先后碰撞激发两个汞原子跃迁至 n=2 能级, 剩余动能一定小于 0.5 eV"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2611-q14","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2611","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2611-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3a3e2fd158f41a69fffd8b4969b634bfa3dda45eee1f48f588162c81d7b398cf","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题(Ⅰ、Ⅱ两题共14分)\n14-Ⅰ. (7分)(1)很多探究实验中会用到电火花计时器,则应按（填空）图中的方法连接电源。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9b8334661630e9046aa3df55de2d143d3bd028ed889b12ace86c2b0fe4f25c32.png","width":349,"height":211,"width_mm":40.95,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2611-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6c844818fe2d0304a4899ff291b176823e9a693b14665fe33acce447136a1f56.png","width":335,"height":211,"w